# ============================================================================
# ASTRO SIVAM — Namakaran (baby naming) page-2 MEANING GLOSSARY
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# One row = one English meaning used by data/namakaran_name_bank.psv, with the
# Tamil and Hindi text printed under the name on page 2 of the report.
#
# COLUMNS (pipe separated, exactly 3):
#   1. english  The meaning exactly as written in the name bank
#   2. tamil    Tamil script only — printed by the Tamil report
#   3. hindi    Devanagari only — printed by the Hindi report
#
# Rebuild the two report engines after any edit:
#     node scripts/build_namakaran_glossary.mjs
# ============================================================================
